            "description": "<p>Deprecated. Use <a>DescribeLoa</a> instead.</p> <p>Gets the LOA-CFA for a connection.</p> <p>The Letter of Authorization - Connecting Facility Assignment (LOA-CFA) is a document that your APN partner or service provider uses when establishing your cross connect to Amazon Web Services at the colocation facility. For more information, see <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/directconnect/latest/UserGuide/Colocation.html\">Requesting Cross Connects at Direct Connect Locations</a> in the <i>Direct Connect User Guide</i>.</p>"
